    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\n1. Create a Google Sheet.\n2. Put these headers in row 1, exactly:\n\n`id | fullName | age | gender | company | department | jobTitle | country | role`\n\n3. Open **Google Sheets - Upsert Users**.\n4. Select your Google Sheets credential.\n5. Replace `PASTE_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE` with the spreadsheet ID.\n6. The workflow targets the first tab (`gid=0`).\n7. Test with **Manual Trigger**.\n8. Publish/activate to enable the daily 07:00 schedule.\n\nThe PII cleaning node uses an allowlist, so source fields not explicitly allowed cannot reach Google Sheets.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 410
